WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.240
Ah... no...

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:07.220
D-Don't get so close... while watching...

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.430
Darling?

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:17.390
I'll be with you forever and ever...

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.410
Where are you, my Darling?

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:26.500
Darling? Darling!!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:40.060
Huh? I'm back to normal.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.430
Rizel!!

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.380
Oh, thank goodness you've woken up!

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.480
You've been unconscious for three days!

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.230
Papas...

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:50.020
What about my husband?

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:01.520
Darling! Darling!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.040
DARLING!!!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.400
It's your turn, Iwaki-kun!

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.040
Hey, look!

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.440
Whoa, cool!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.860
Hey you two, we're on a school field trip,
not your honeymoon.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.520
Oh, cut it out...

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:02.800
Just draw already.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:06.420
Aw, not the Old Maid!

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:09.280
I drew it again!

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.040
Okay, Genki-kun, your turn.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.420
Something's not right here.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.330
Do you feel like something's missing?

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.600
Like what?

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.450
I'm not sure, but...

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:24.260
Oh, I get it! I bet you're
missing Natsumi-sensei!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:28.140
You just can't give up on her, can you...
Want me to call her over here?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.670
Natsumi-sen- Whoa, what are you doing?

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:35.440
I never asked you to call her, you idiot!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.700
What's wrong?

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:40.520
Still, something's missing...

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.570
Darling!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.020
Darling!

00:03:57.020 --> 00:04:00.300
Darling... Darling!!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:05.130
My husband... isn't waking up...

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.800
He's been sleeping this whole time...

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:12.220
He has no visible external wounds,
but head trauma has left him comatose.

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.740
Darling...!

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:24.360
Wow, it's the ocean!

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:42.210
What is this? Has... something like this
happened before?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.520
What? Why am I diving...?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.740
What's going to happen to him?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.010
We've done all that we can;

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:19.870
Everything hinges on tonight's developments.
If he doesn't wake up...

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:21.770
No! It can't be!

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:26.930
It'll be all right. Tomonori isn't the type to give up so easily, you know.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.510
That's right. He'll recover soon...

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.180
Darling...

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.300
They fell asleep already? They're no fun...

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.530
Just now...

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:56.120
That's right! There <i>is</i>  something missing!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.030
What's wrong, Iwaki-kun?

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.510
Sensei, someone is missing!

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:07.050
You know, that transfer student that sat next to Seimoto?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.890
She was only 12 years old,
but she wound up in our class.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:13.570
And before that, she used the
Power of the State to make me-

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.510
Huh? What was I...?

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:19.560
What are you talking about?
Nothing like that could have happened.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.800
But-

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.130
Just forget about that, Iwaki-kun.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.480
It's not like you had
a relationship with her.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.960
We didn't have a "relationship"?

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:31.040
Aren't you only interested in older women?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.960
Come to think of it, why do I...

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.890
Open your eyes, Darling...

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:43.960
Please!

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.860
Was that me, when I was six?

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:59.070
Okay, Tomonori-kun!
Keep your eyes in front of you.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.850
It's from when I was in 3rd grade...

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:05.330
Why <i>do</i>  I like older women?

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.860
Why should I care?!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.660
Hmm? What's wrong, Tomo-kun?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:13.400
Heh... I think he's a bit shy.
The boy has a thing for older girls.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.890
Why did it start back then?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.850
Darling...

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.770
Open your eyes...

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:37.390
I won't ever ask you to go
on a date with me again...

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:44.040
I'll be all right,
even if you never carry me again...

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.450
You don't ever have to do
anything for me again...

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.380
So please...

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.840
Darling...

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.300
A scene from my childhood?

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:25.400
That's dangerous, lady!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:32.460
NO!!!

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.610
What am I doing?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:50.260
A large bosom... so warm and soft...

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.380
Who... are you?

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.640
Why are you crying? Hey...

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:06.740
The first human warmth I ever felt
was from you, Darling...

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:11.530
That's why I'm able to be here
and be me right now.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.430
So...

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.710
Please, wake up!

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:20.280
Stay with me! Don't die!

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:23.000
Open your eyes, Darling!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.270
Ri... ze... l...

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:33.310
Ri... ze... l...

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:34.230
Ri... ze... l...

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.930
I see... It was Rizel!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.590
Darling...

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:46.720
Rizel!

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.140
Darling!

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:49.640
Rizel!

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:51.440
Darling!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.830
Rizel!

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:55.720
Darling!!

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.450
Darling...

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.390
Darling...!

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.350
Rizel...

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.650
Thank goodness! You're awake!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.040
Darling?

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:40.950
It's the first time you've embraced me.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.030
I was dreaming...

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:46.400
...that when I was a kid...

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.540
...I saved you.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.010
That wasn't a dream.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:57.750
Ever since then, I've been waiting for the day when I would meet you again.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:01.180
Rizel's growth stopped
when she was 12 years old.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:05.680
When she met you that time,
her cells exhibited a slight change.

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:11.950
Our studies led us to conclude that Rizel
needed to know love in order to grow up.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:17.450
So until she met you again,
Rizel's cells remained in a 12-year-old state.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:20.920
I see... So that's why...

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:23.420
I looked everywhere,
but I could never find you.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:27.760
But somewhere in my heart, I kept longing...

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:30.260
...for an older version of you.

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:31.970
Darling...

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.870
Rizel...

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:42.260
Wait, that means...

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.470
Oh, Darling! You're on the mend,
but you're still "in the mood"?

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.920
I've endured so much trauma over my older-woman fetish.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.660
And it's all YOUR FAULT!!!

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:56.350
My first time being thrown
while I'm on the mend!

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.240
I'm heading out!

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.920
Ahh, wait for me, Darling!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:11.050
Tomonori-kun's still acting cold to Rizel.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.910
Oh, I don't know about that...

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:19.140
Ah! Gotcha!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.230
Let go, silly.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:24.760
Why, why? Why should I let go?
Aren't we married?

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.770
I never agreed to anything of the sort.

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.140
You're so shy!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.520
Whatever.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.070
Darling!

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:32.800
Aah, Cut it out! That's not safe!
Darling!

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:33.240
Aah, Cut it out! That's not safe!

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:33.760
Darling~!
Aah, Cut it out! That's not safe!

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:34.350
Darling~!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:34.930
I'm telling you, that's dangerous!
Darling~!

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:35.460
I'm telling you, that's dangerous!

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:36.600
Darling!!
I'm telling you, that's dangerous!

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.310
Darling!!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.680
Kurumi here! Haruka here! Eri here!

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:14.190
It's suddenly time for... a school field trip!

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:16.910
Okay, a haiku whose lines
start with kyo-u-to:

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:20.180
I imagine that (<u>kyo</u>kon da yo)
his "root" is ever so large. (<u>u</u>ttori suru ne)
It fascinates me... (<u>to</u>ttemo ne)

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:23.830
You know so much...
even about imaginary roots of equations!

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.400
Kurumi here! Haruka here! Eri here!

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.870
It's suddenly time for... a school field trip!

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:32.920
Day one: Kyoto!

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.160
If you visit Kyoto,
you have to see the Daimonji!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.130
Okay, let's try to make a verse
whose lines start with da-i-mo-n-ji!

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:40.450
"Oh, my dear husband" (<u>da</u>nna-sama)
"Spread a lot on me" (<u>i</u>ppai kakete)
"I want more of it" (<u>mo</u>tto hoshii)

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:43.110
"Mm, yes... oh, yes, I do!" (<u>n</u>fufun hafuun)
"Please don't tease me~" (<u>ji</u>rashicha iya iya)

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.710
In the Kansai area,
don't they put mayonnaise in yakisoba?

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:48.490
They do. It's almost addictingly good!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.710
They'd better not tease me;
I hope they squirt a ton of it in mine!

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.710
Please!
